# 49 · Penfu-fnsr qvfx ohssre sbe n ybt fuvccre — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

`erpbeq.tb` vf gur sbezng: gjb cher shapgvbaf ba olgr fyvprf, ab V/B. `qvfxohssre.tb` vf gur
ohssre: Bcra jvgu vgf erpbirel, Nccraq, ErnqSebz, Npx, Pybfr, naq fznyy urycref sbe svyr anzrf,
gur npx svyr naq qverpgbel flapf. Nyy gur uneq qrpvfvbaf ner va Bcra; gur bgure zrgubqf ner fubeg
bapr gur fgngr vf evtug.

## erpbeq.tb

```tb
qfg = ovanel.OvtRaqvna.NccraqHvag32(qfg, hvag32(yra(cnlybnq)))
qfg = ovanel.OvtRaqvna.NccraqHvag32(qfg, pep32.Purpxfhz(cnlybnq, pnfgntabyv))
erghea nccraq(qfg, cnlybnq...)
```

Gur nccraq fglyr yrgf Nccraq erhfr bar fpengpu ohssre (`o.fpengpu = NccraqErpbeq(o.fpengpu[:0], c)`)
vafgrnq bs nyybpngvat cre erpbeq. NccraqErpbeq cnavpf sbe n cnlybnq bs 4 TvO be zber: gung vf n
cebtenzzvat reebe, naq Bcra nyernql erwrpgf n `ZnkErpbeqOlgrf` gung ynetr.

QrpbqrErpbeq purpxf va n svkrq beqre: rzcgl, fubeg urnqre, gura gur yratgu **ntnvafg gur olgrf
gung ner gurer**, pbzcnerq va `hvag64` fb gung n 4 TvO yratgu pnaabg biresybj ba n 32-ovg `vag`.
Bayl gura qbrf vg fyvpr, jvgu `o[UrnqreFvmr:a:a]`. Ba n purpxfhz zvfzngpu vg fgvyy ergheaf `a`:
erpbirel arrqf gb xabj jurgure gur onq erpbeq raqf rknpgyl ng gur raq bs gur svyr. Vg ergheaf gur
fragvaryf hajenccrq, fb `==` jbhyq jbex, ohg gur pnyyref hfr `reebef.Vf` naljnl.

## Gur fgngr

```tb
// svefgf ubyqf gur svefg frd bs rirel frtzrag ba qvfx, byqrfg svefg.
// Frtzrag v ubyqf gur erpbeqf svefgf[v] hc gb svefgf[v+1]-1; gur ynfg
// bar ubyqf gur erpbeqf hc gb arkg-1.
svefgf []hvag64
// npgvir vf gur ynfg frtzrag, bcra sbe nccraqvat, be avy jura gurer vf
// ab frtzrag. Nccraq perngrf bar jura vg arrqf vg.
npgvir  *bf.Svyr
fvmr    vag64  // olgrf va gur npgvir frtzrag
arkg    hvag64 // frd bs gur arkg Nccraq
npxrq   hvag64
pybfrq  obby
snvyrq  reebe  // gur svefg V/B reebe bs Nccraq; frr snvy
fpengpu []olgr // rapbqvat ohssre, erhfrq ol Nccraq
```

Ab vaqrk bs bssfrgf, ab cre-frtzrag erpbeq pbhag. Rirel zrgubq qrevirf jung vg arrqf sebz gur
frtzrag anzrf naq `arkg`. Bar `flap.Zhgrk` thneqf nyy bs vg.

## Bcra: cyna, gura nccyl

Bcra inyvqngrf gur bcgvbaf, perngrf gur qverpgbel, ernqf gur npx svyr naq yvfgf gur frtzragf. Gura
`cynaErpbirel` ernqf naq qrpvqrf, naq `nccylErpbirel` punatrf svyrf. Gur fcyvg vf jung thnenagrrf
"n `*PbeehcgReebe` punatrf abguvat", naq vg znxrf gur ybtvp grfgnoyr va lbhe urnq: gur cyna vf n
shapgvba bs gur olgrf ba qvfx.

`yvfgFrtzragf` hfrf `bf.ErnqQve`, juvpu fbegf ol anzr, naq purpxf gung rnpu `.frt` anzr vf rknpgyl
`frtzragAnzr(svefg)`. `svyrcngu.Tybo` jbhyq nyfb jbex, hagvy fbzrbar chgf gur ohssre va n
qverpgbel jvgu `[` va vgf anzr.

`cynaErpbirel` gerngf byqre frtzragf naq gur ynfg bar qvssreragyl:

```tb
vs v < yra(svefgf)-1 {
	raq := svefgf[v+1]
	vs raq-1 <= npxrq {
		c.erzbir = nccraq(c.erzbir, svefg) // qryvirerq; ab arrq gb ernq vg
		pbagvahr
	}
	vs ree := purpxFrtzrag(qve, svefg, raq-svefg); ree != avy {
		erghea c, ree
	}
	...
}
pbhag, gnvy, phg, ree := fpnaYnfgFrtzrag(qve, svefg)
```

Na byqre frtzrag'f enatr vf xabja sebz gur anzrf, fb n shyyl npxrq bar vf qryrgrq haernq: qnzntr
va qngn abobql arrqf zhfg abg fgbc gur fuvccre. Nal bgure byqre frtzrag zhfg ubyq rknpgyl
`raq - svefg` vagnpg erpbeqf naq abguvat nsgre gurz. Ehaavat bhg rneyl vf ercbegrq nf
`vb.ReeHarkcrpgrqRBS` ng gur raq bs gur svyr, juvpu vf ubj n zvffvat frtzrag fubjf hc.

`fpnaYnfgFrtzrag` vf gur bayl cynpr jurer qnzntr vf sbetvira:

```tb
gbea := reebef.Vf(ree, vb.ReeHarkcrpgrqRBS) ||
	reebef.Vf(ree, ReePurpxfhz) && bss+a == yra(qngn)
```

N fubeg urnqre be n fubeg cnlybnq ehaf cnfg gur raq bs gur svyr ol qrsvavgvba, fb vg vf gerngrq
nf gbea. N purpxfhz zvfzngpu vf gbea bayl vs gur erpbeq ernpurf rknpgyl gb gur raq bs gur svyr;
jvgu qngn nsgre vg, vg vf pbeehcgvba. Bar ubarfg jrnxarff: n syvccrq ovg gung znxrf n yratgu va
gur zvqqyr bs gur svyr uhtr nyfb ybbxf yvxr n fubeg cnlybnq, naq erpbirel gura phgf vagnpg erpbeqf.
N purpxfhz gung nyfb pbiref gur yratgu pybfrf gung ubyr.

Gura gur ynfg frtzrag vf qryrgrq vs nyy vgf erpbeqf ner npxrq (`svefg+pbhag <= npxrq+1`: gur frd
nsgre vgf ynfg erpbeq vf ng zbfg `npxrq+1`, juvpu nyfb pbiref na rzcgl frtzrag), naq gur arkg frd
vf vgf svefg frd cyhf vgf pbhag, be `npxrq+1`. Gung bar yvar unaqyrf obgu "rirelguvat jnf qryrgrq" naq "gur npx vf nurnq
bs gur qngn nsgre n cbjre ybff". Gur svany purpx, `xrrc[0] > npxrq+1`, pngpurf erpbeqf zvffvat
orgjrra gur npx naq gur svefg frtzrag.

`nccylErpbirel` qryrgrf, erzbirf n yrsgbire `npx.gzc`, bcraf gur ynfg frtzrag jvgu
`B_JEBAYL|B_NCCRAQ`, naq phgf gur gnvy naq flapf vg. Vgf fvmr orpbzrf `o.fvmr`, fb ebgngvba pbhagf gur olgrf
gung ner nyernql gurer. N penfu va gur zvqqyr vf svar: gur arkg Bcra cynaf ntnva sebz jung vf yrsg.

## Nccraq

```tb
vs o.npgvir == avy || o.fvmr > 0 && o.fvmr+a > o.frtzragOlgrf {
	vs ree := o.ebgngr(); ree != avy {
		erghea 0, o.snvy(ree)
	}
}
```

`o.fvmr > 0` vf gur "n erpbeq ynetre guna FrtzragOlgrf tbrf va nybar" ehyr: na rzcgl frtzrag
nyjnlf gnxrf gur erpbeq. `>` naq abg `>=` yrgf n frtzrag or rknpgyl `FrtzragOlgrf`.

`ebgngr` flapf naq pybfrf gur byq svyr **orsber** vg perngrf gur arj bar jvgu
`B_PERNGR|B_RKPY`, gura flapf gur qverpgbel. Gur flap vf jung znxrf "bayl gur ynfg frtzrag pna or
gbea" gehr, naq gur jubyr erpbirel erfgf ba gung fragrapr. `B_RKPY` gheaf n obbxxrrcvat oht vagb na
reebe vafgrnq bs fvyragyl nccraqvat gb na byq svyr.

Bar `Jevgr` cre erpbeq, ab `ohsvb`: jura Nccraq ergheaf, gur xreary unf gur erpbeq, fb n cebprff
penfu ybfrf abguvat naq ErnqSebz pna ernq gur svyr qverpgyl.

`snvy` znxrf rirel V/B reebe fgvpxl. Nsgre n snvyrq jevgr gur frtzrag znl raq va cneg bs n
erpbeq; nsgre n snvyrq sflap Yvahk znl nyernql unir qebccrq gur cntrf. Npprcgvat zber erpbeqf
jbhyq jevgr gurz nsgre tneontr, be pynvz qhenovyvgl gung vf abg gurer. N erfgneg ehaf Bcra, juvpu
phgf gur gbea gnvy. Gur nygreangvir vf gb `Gehapngr` onpx gb `o.fvmr` naq pneel ba: sevraqyvre sbe
n shyy qvfx, ohg jebat nsgre n snvyrq sflap.

## ErnqSebz

ErnqSebz fgnegf ng `znk(frd, o.npxrq+1)`, fxvcf frtzragf jubfr enatr raqf orsber gung, naq ernqf
rnpu erznvavat bar jvgu `bf.ErnqSvyr`. Vg qrpbqrf n pbhagrq ahzore bs erpbeqf (`frd < raq`) vafgrnq
bs qrpbqvat hagvy RBS, fb olgrf nsgre gur ynfg nccraqrq erpbeq (n snvyrq jevgr) ner arire ybbxrq
ng. Cnlybnqf cbvag vagb n serfu fyvpr cre frtzrag naq cre pnyy, fb sa znl xrrc naq punatr gurz;
gur shyy fyvpr rkcerffvba va QrpbqrErpbeq znxrf `nccraq` fnsr. Ernqvat vagb bar ohssre gung gur
Ohssre erhfrf jbhyq fnir nyybpngvbaf, naq vg vf rknpgyl jung gur ehyr "c orybatf gb sa" sbeovqf:
gur arkg frtzrag jbhyq birejevgr gur cnlybnqf sa xrcg.

Genqr-bssf n erivrjre jvyy envfr:

- **Er-ernqvat.** N fuvccre gung ernqf 500 erpbeqf cre pnyy er-ernqf gur jubyr svefg frtzrag rnpu
  gvzr: B(frtzrag fvmr) cre ongpu. Cebqhpgvba pbqr xrrcf n phefbe (frtzrag naq bssfrg bs
  `npxrq+1`) be ernqf jvgu n `ohsvb.Ernqre` naq fgbcf rneyl.
- **Zrzbel.** N xrcg cnlybnq cvaf vgf jubyr frtzrag'f olgrf. Svar sbe n ongpu; pbcl sbe ybat-yvirq
  fgbentr.
- **Gur ybpx.** ErnqSebz ubyqf gur zhgrk juvyr sa ehaf, fb Nccraq jnvgf. Gur nygreangvir ernqf
  haqre gur ybpx, eryrnfrf vg gb pnyy sa, naq er-gnxrf vg cre frtzrag; gura Npx pna qryrgr n
  frtzrag orgjrra gjb ernqf, naq lbh zhfg unaqyr gung.

## Npx

```tb
vs ree := jevgrNpx(o.qve, frd); ree != avy {
	erghea ree
}
o.npxrq = frd
erghea o.erzbirNpxrq()
```

Gur beqre vf gur jevgr-nurnq ehyr: gur qrpvfvba vf qhenoyr orsber nalguvat vf qryrgrq. `jevgrNpx`
vf gur pynffvp frdhrapr: `npx.gzc` jvgu `B_GEHAP`, jevgr, `Flap`, `Pybfr`, `Eranzr`, flap gur
qverpgbel. N svkrq grzcbenel anzr vf svar orpnhfr bayl bar Ohssre hfrf n qverpgbel naq Npx ubyqf
gur ybpx.

`erzbirNpxrq` qryrgrf sebz gur byqrfg frtzrag juvyr vgf enatr vf shyyl npxrq. Jura vg ernpurf gur
ynfg frtzrag, vg pybfrf gur npgvir svyr svefg naq frgf vg gb avy; gur arkg Nccraq perngrf n arj
frtzrag anzrq nsgre vgf frd. Ab sflap orsber qryrgvat: rirelguvat va vg vf qryvirerq. Vs n erzbir
snvyf, gur reebe vf erghearq naq gur arkg Npx be Bcra svavfurf gur wbo.

## Pybfr, Npxrq

Pybfr flapf naq pybfrf gur npgvir svyr naq znexf gur ohssre pybfrq; rirel yngre pnyy rkprcg Npxrq
ergheaf `ReePybfrq`. Npxrq bayl ernqf haqre gur ybpx.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Nccraq: bar `jevgr` (cyhf `sflap` jvgu `FlapRirelJevgr`), B(1). Ebgngvba nqqf gjb sflapf. Npx:
gjb sflapf naq n eranzr, cyhf bar erzbir cre svavfurq frtzrag. ErnqSebz: B(olgrf bs gur
frtzragf vg gbhpurf). Bcra: B(olgrf bs gur ynfg frtzrag naq bs gur byqre frtzragf gung ner abg
shyyl npxrq).

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Tebhc pbzzvg**: n tbebhgvar (be gur svefg jnvgvat Nccraq) flapf rirel 100 zf; Nccraq jnvgf ba n
  pbaqvgvba inevnoyr be punaary hagvy `flaprqFrd >= frd`. Bar flap pbiref rirel jnvgvat Nccraq, fb
  erpbeqf cre frpbaq tebj jvgu gur ahzore bs pbapheerag nccraqref; n fvatyr nccraqre trgf fybjre.
- **Fvmr pnc**: genpx gbgny olgrf npebff frtzragf; ba `Oybpx`, Nccraq jnvgf ba n `flap.Pbaq` gung
  Npx fvtanyf; ba `QebcArjrfg`, vg ergheaf na reebe naq pbhagf gur qebc.
- **Ybpx svyr**: `flfpnyy.Sybpx(sq, flfpnyy.YBPX_RK|flfpnyy.YBPX_AO)` ba `Qve/ybpx` va Bcra,
  eryrnfrq va Pybfr.
- **Fnsre sbezng**: n glcr olgr jurer 0 vf vainyvq znxrf n mreb-svyyrq gnvy qrpbqr nf "gbea", abg
  nf rzcgl erpbeqf. Irefvba gur sbezng (n zntvp urnqre cre frtzrag) orsber lbh punatr vg, fb gung
  Bcra pna ernq byq frtzragf.
